```cs
Debug.Assert(New_Ret >= 0, "If the return value is non-negative, x is in the old array");
```

This assert statement checks whether the return value of `arrList.IndexOf(x)` is non-negative. If it is, this means that `x` is indeed in the original list `arrList`. The second parameter to `Debug.Assert` is the message that will be displayed if the assert statement is false.
